# My Website Opener - Chrome Extension

Simple Chrome Extension to open any website URL with one click.
All code included in this README - no other file needed to understand.

---

## 📁 Project Structure

MyExtension/
├── manifest.json
├── popup.html
├── popup.js
└── README.md

---

## 📄 File 1: manifest.json
```json
{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "My Website Opener",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Open your website in one click",
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "popup.html",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "icon.png",
      "48": "icon.png",
      "128": "icon.png"
    }
  },
  "permissions": ["tabs"]
}
